  "releaseNotes": "Redirects are followed by CrawlSharp with loop detection and a MaxRedirects limit, so redirect loops no longer hang a crawl; credentials are sent only to the start origin (plus CredentialOrigins), authentication settings are validated, and WebResource gains FinalUrl, RedirectChain and RedirectOutcome. FollowRedirects = false now returns the redirect response itself.",
